# Real seed PII lives OUTSIDE the repo (~/.opensidebar/seed via OPENSIDEBAR_SEED_DIR).
# Belt-and-braces against a stray local recreation under the old in-tree path —
# the committed synthetic kit at tests/e2e/fixtures/live-app-kit/ is fake and safe.
.artifacts/seed/
**/seed/applications/

